  "goodToKnow": "Der Aktionismus is hasty, often pointless activity for show, almost always critical: blinder Aktionismus, politischer Aktionismus. Critics use it when politicians react to a crisis with quick but ineffective measures. Positive activism is das Engagement or der Aktivismus. In art history, der Wiener Aktionismus was a radical 1960s performance art movement in Vienna. It has no plural."
